OL,3,A'When England changed forever': Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry and its most famous scene wow
OL,5,ALondon viewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FWant the best viewing experience? Get
OL,8,Fup close and keep an eye on the birds.
OL,9,FIf you missed tickets this time,
OL,10,Fthere's still hope
OL,12,FFifty-eight scenes, 737 animals, 620
OL,13,Fmen, six women, and five (or maybe six)
OL,14,Fhuman penises - the Bayeux Tapestry in
OL,15,Fnumbers
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
